<title>JAPAN: Yamatake-Honeywell -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamatake-Honeywell -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 55.91		vs	   52.92</p>
<p> Operating	    1.62		vs	    1.28</p>
<p> Current		1.95		vs	    1.73</p>
<p> Net		    1.46		vs	    1.02</p>
<p> EPS		   16.72 yen	  vs	   12.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     89 million	  vs	  84 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.50 yen	  vs	    5.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamatake-Honeywell Co Ltd is a total automation equipment maker.</p>
</text>
